WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.920
It <00:00:00.160>was <00:00:00.320>night, <00:00:01.120>and <00:00:01.300>he <00:00:01.420>was <00:00:01.560>walking

00:00:01.920 --> 00:00:03.500
against <00:00:02.320>a <00:00:02.540>violent <00:00:02.940>wind,

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:06.480
through <00:00:04.100>thick <00:00:04.420>fog, <00:00:05.320>holding <00:00:05.540>a <00:00:05.760>tiny <00:00:06.040>flame

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:07.580
cupped <00:00:06.920>in <00:00:07.040>his <00:00:07.180>hands.
